@@ -10,3 +10,8 @@ Run its tests with `npm test`.
 Each task has a stable `id` that remains unchanged when its title is renamed. `add` returns that ID,
 and `get(id)` retrieves the task. `find`, `complete`, `reopen`, `rename`, `tag`, `untag`, and `remove`
 accept either a task title or its ID; prefer IDs when a reference must survive a rename.
+
+Each task also has `createdAt` and `updatedAt` ISO-8601 date-time strings. They start equal, and
+`updatedAt` advances whenever a task is completed, reopened, renamed, tagged or untagged with an
+actual change. `createTodoList` accepts an optional timestamp function for callers that need to
+control the time source; by default it uses the current time.
