+---
+id: task-002-record-task-timestamps
+type: task
+title: "Record task timestamps"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Add ISO-8601 `createdAt` and `updatedAt` timestamps to each task. Initialize both to the same time when
+adding a task. Advance `updatedAt` whenever completing, reopening, renaming, tagging or untagging makes a
+change to the task. Keep clock access outside the domain layer.
